  "intro": {
    "summary": "Centuries ago the Barbarian Kelvinos, a hero of great power and fame, drove the Frozen Horror from Ice Mountain and ended its reign of terror. He never came back from that last battle and his body was never found. Some say he walks again as an undead servant of Dread. The heroes start at the iron door and explore until they find the wooden exit door that leads closer to the Frozen Horror."
