      "effects": [
        {
          "id": "e1",
          "type": "showText",
          "text": "Kelvinos, the Barbarian hero of old, is now one of the Frozen Horror's undead slaves. He stands on the square marked KEL. Use the spare Barbarian figure, or any other figure, for him. His stats: Movement 5, Attack 4, Defend 4, Body 4, Mind 0.",
